      "reasoning": null,
      "thinking": "Turn 2 with Forest, Plains. Play Haru (1/1, triggers on allies). Or Raucous Audience (2/1 mana dork). Haru gives earthbending when allies enter later. Raucous Audience gives ramp now — turn 3 could play Jailer (needs W, have Plains). With Audience ramp, turn 4 could play General. Audience first seems better for ramp, and Haru triggers off allies entering — Audience is an Ally? Probably, but Audience is already in play so it doesn't matter order.\n\
