\n\
The earthbend trigger gives me a hasty 1/1 land this turn which could... I already passed combat. Hmm, haste doesn't matter now.\n\
\n\
Mana plan: cast Audience now with Forest+Plains, keep Forest untapped for... nothing else castable except Rebuke needs {1}{G} — no. So just cast Audience.\n\
\n\
Actually wait — should I cast Jailer to deal with Warden? The Warden attacking each turn with menace for 2 damage plus Ascension quest counters. Jailer exiles it (MV 3+? Vindictive Warden — need mana value. It's {3} activated ability... its cost unknown, but likely MV ≤4). The choice list shows it as castable; exile condition \"mana value 3 or greater\" is a choice made at resolution.\n\
\n\
I think tempo favors casting Jailer next turn and developing now. But taking 2/turn from menace Warden... at 18hp, fine. Ramp plan: Turn 4: 4 lands + earthbent land = cast Earth Kingdom General ({3}{G}), earthbend 2, gain life. That's strong.\n\
