      "thinking": "Wait — Raucous Audience entered? Board shows Raucous Audience 2/1 (sick) — yes it resolved. But no earthbent land visible... Haru's trigger may have resolved already; Forest (tapped) might be the earthbent land? Hard to say.\n\
\n\
