          "arguments": "{\"summary\": \"Raucous Audience resolved. Opponent attacks with 2/2 token and 2/3 menace Vindictive Warden. Only Haru (1/1) can block (Audience is summoning sick), and Warden has menace. Trading Haru for a token loses my earthbend engine, so I take 4 and keep developing.\", \"choice\": \"no\", \"rationale\": \"Declining to block: Haru would just die to the token, and the menace Warden is unblockable alone. Taking 4 keeps my Ally engine alive for bigger turns ahead.\"}",
